  },
  {
   "id": "464d5f51-6fd8-4c52-90e0-1c5798f83b09",
   "build_id": "6861f8ca-3e80-44c4-9d10-9969d29710f6",
   "author_id": "58fca509-fa5d-4e53-9a7a-016519ca59d6",
   "parent_id": null,
   "body": "Is there any good working weak aura for this spec? I can’t find one",
   "upvotes": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-07-19T04:31:00.432758+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-20T21:56:02.691065+00:00",
   "downvotes": 0,
   "hidden": false,
   "author": {
    "id": "58fca509-fa5d-4e53-9a7a-016519ca59d6",
    "username": "Jason Martinez",
    "avatar_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-QpEUfqKTABzehhKJFxIqRKzcmB0VWLuAyOeFrBtgQWHO75NO=s96-c"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "1ed6f31a-64f3-4a4b-88b8-bd5ab5ee4e6d",
   "build_id": "6861f8ca-3e80-44c4-9d10-9969d29710f6",
   "author_id": "993a2c55-2007-4e92-91f0-21078d370291",
   "parent_id": null,
   "body": "You can’t run Shadra’s Aid, Serpent Lord’s Amulet, and Cycle of Rebirth together. Cycle of Rebirth is great when the tank is taking heavy damage, but Serpent Lord’s Ritual lets you fire off Shadra’s Prayer much faster, this should let you keep both the tank and the group alive and give plenty of free cast from Tome of Ahn'kanet. \n\nI consider Sublime Extraction essential because Serpent’s Fang is your emergency button, and being able to use it twice can save the entire party. I also like to play with fewer cooldown abilities, and would skip Extraction and take Ophidian Renewal instead for quality‑of‑life. The rest of the tree looks solid.\n\nWith Vizier Form, mana is never an issue, you can spam your spells freely without ever needing to drink. If you are low on Mana (like after a Battle Rez or from Mana Drain), Shadra's Prayer should assure you Free Heal and with Replenishment you will be back to full mana.",
   "upvotes": 1,
   "created_at": "2026-07-20T16:11:07.458371+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-20T21:56:05.712228+00:00",
